    <rich_text link="webs https://github.com/reynalynsaavedrasamar25/SchemaX-SIS">https://github.com/reynalynsaavedrasamar25/SchemaX-SIS</rich_text>
    <rich_text>


</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h2">2. PROJECT OVERVIEW</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
The Student Information System (SIS) is a desktop application developed using C# Windows Forms and MySQL.
The system is designed to help users manage student information through a simple and organized interface.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Main Features:</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
• Add new student records

• View existing student information

• Search for student records

• Edit student details

• Delete student records

• Validate user input

• Handle errors and log exceptions


</rich_text>
    <rich_text style="italic">Note: These are the project's intended features. Some functions are still under development and integration.</rich_text>
    <rich_text>


</rich_text>
