Responsible for checking required fields and input formats.

</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h3">7.2 Exception Handling</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">File:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Helpers/ExceptionHandler.cs
Responsible for:
◇ Handling application exceptions.

◇ Displaying user-friendly error messages.

◇ Calling the error logging helper.



</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h3">7.3 Error Logging</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">File:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Helpers/ErrorLog.cs
Responsible for:
◇ Recording exception information.

◇ Adding timestamps to error entries.

◇ Writing errors to logs/errors.txt.


</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Logging Status:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Previously tested successfully.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Database Exception Handling:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Pending integration and testing.


